1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,600
ProphetGrid: conditional macro and tech markets,
adjudicated by validators instead of an admin key.

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:09,200
Every pool unit sits in an on-chain custody vault,
so no operator can move trader collateral.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:13,800
Markets resolve only through live consensus
over the primary source and the filed evidence.

4
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:18,400
The What-If simulator shows implied odds,
pro rata payout, ROI and exact dust conservation.

5
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:23,000
Confidence is quantized to five anchors.
Validators must agree exactly on the band.

6
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:27,600
Evidence is sanitized: tags defused, brackets stripped,
text truncated before it reaches the prompt.

7
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:32,200
The Security Guard Lab triggers a real revert:
a premature claim is refused on chain.

8
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:36,800
Pots and challenge bonds stay reserved
until the challenge window closes.

9
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:41,400
Switch burner identities, mint test collateral
and trade YES or NO shares.

10
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:46,900
Payouts are exact. Rounding dust goes to the last
claimant, so the vault balances to zero.
